outputs.artifact-url⟩) - Detailed diff analysis\n';
}
body += '- [Github Actions Run](https://github.com/⟨EXPR:github.repository⟩/actions/runs/⟨EXPR:github.run_id⟩) - View the full coverage report';

// Find existing coverage comment
